From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthoine Bourgeois <anthoine.bourgeois@vates.tech>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:17:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tapdisk: nbdserver: Fix the handshake error path

The option negociation error path enabled the client on a failed and
close fd handshake.

Signed-off-by: Anthoine Bourgeois <anthoine.bourgeois@vates.tech>
---
 drivers/tapdisk-nbdserver.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/tapdisk-nbdserver.c b/drivers/tapdisk-nbdserver.c
index 66657c35..dcbb659c 100644
--- a/drivers/tapdisk-nbdserver.c
+++ b/drivers/tapdisk-nbdserver.c
@@ -1062,7 +1062,9 @@ tapdisk_nbdserver_handshake_cb(event_id_t id, char mode, void *data)
 	/* Receive newstyle options. */
 	if (receive_newstyle_options(client, server->handshake_fd, no_zeroes) == -1) {
 		INFO("Option negotiation terminated");
+		/* The client aborted or failed the negotiation: do not enable it */
 		close(server->handshake_fd);
+		goto out;
 	}
 
 	INFO("About to enable client on fd %d", client->client_fd);
